<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Tip Calculator" description="Read how Tip Calculator handles calculator inputs, local preferences, and privacy on this browser-based site."><ContentPage title="Privacy policy" intro="This policy describes what the current Tip Calculator website does and does not need in order to work."><h2>Information you enter</h2><p>The calculator does not require an account, name, email address, or other personal information. Bill amounts, tip choices, split counts, currency selections, and options are used in your browser to produce the displayed result.</p><h2>Local browser preferences</h2><p>The site uses your browser’s local storage to remember the selected theme and currency on this device. This preference is stored locally so the site can restore your choice when you return. You can remove it through your browser settings.</p><h2>Copying a result</h2><p>If you use the copy-result control, your browser is asked to copy the displayed calculation to your clipboard. The site does not need to collect the copied text.</p><h2>What the current site does not use</h2><p>The current project does not require analytics, advertising, tracking, accounts, or a contact form, and it does not need third-party services to perform calculations. The site should not be understood to collect personal information that it does not actually request.</p><h2>Future changes</h2><p>If advertising, analytics, forms, embedded services, or another feature that changes information handling is added later, this policy will be updated to explain that change before or when the feature is introduced.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:uranuragsingh@gmail.com">uranuragsingh@gmail.com</a>.</p></ContentPage></Layout>
